title: Burger Sauce
source: Cook's Illustrated
tags: sauce, condiment
---

Whisk together @mayonnaise{2%tbsp}, @ketchup{1%tbsp}, @mustard{1%tbsp}, @relish{1/2%tsp}, @white vinegar{1/2%tsp}, @sugar{1/2%tsp}, and @pepper{1/4%tsp} in a #small bowl{} until smooth.
